From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 18:04:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 103/103] v4l2codecs: Add a JPEG decoder

Add v4l2sl*jpegdec for V4L2 decoders on a media device that take one
complete JFIF image per OUTPUT buffer (V4L2_PIX_FMT_JPEG) and parse the
headers themselves, as the Allwinner cedrus JPEG decoder does. No codec
controls are needed: the media request only binds the image to its
picture buffer. One image is decoded at a time; the OUTPUT buffer size
follows the size of the images.

The sink caps describe what the hardware path decodes, using the
jpegparse caps fields: baseline or extended sequential Huffman coding
(sof-marker 0/1), YCbCr (colorspace sYUV), 4:2:0, 4:2:2, 4:4:4 or 4:1:1
with 1x1 chroma sampling factors (sampling-factors), progressive images.
Greyscale, RGB, CMYK, progressive and lossless JPEG and other sampling
factor layouts are refused at caps negotiation, so decodebin and playbin
plug a software decoder for them. Each image is checked as well: an
unsupported one (e.g. 12-bit samples, a non-interleaved scan) is an
error, a broken one or one the driver returns with the error flag is
dropped with a decode error, so a damaged MJPEG frame does not end the
stream.

4:1:1 is decoded into a linear format only (the driver resamples the
chroma after the job), and the output colorimetry is full range BT.601,
as jpegdec reports it.

The element gets the rank of the other V4L2 stateless decoders.

Signed-off-by: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
---
 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.c | 991 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.h |  31 +
 sys/v4l2codecs/meson.build           |   4 +-
 sys/v4l2codecs/plugin.c              |   7 +
 4 files changed, 1032 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.c
 create mode 100644 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.h

diff --git a/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.c b/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d275d92
--- /dev/null
+++ b/sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codecjpegdec.c
